   "i": 224,
   "start": 659.16,
   "end": 662.12,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "So~... wanna go drive cars?"
  },
  {
   "i": 225,
   "start": 662.12,
   "end": 662.76,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Piccolo",
   "text": "Bitchin'!"
  },
  {
   "i": 226,
   "start": 662.76,
   "end": 667.78,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "♫ I'm on a highway to HFIL! ♫"
  },
  {
   "i": 227,
   "start": 667.78,
   "end": 672.3,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "♫ On a highway to HFIL! ♫"
  },
  {
   "i": 228,
   "start": 672.3,
   "end": 676.32,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Narrator",
   "text": "And thus, they went their seperate ways to prepare for the upcoming threat!"
  },
  {
   "i": 229,
   "start": 676.84,
   "end": 681.02,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Narrator",
   "text": "However, a few of them would find... roadblocks."
  },
  {
   "i": 230,
   "start": 681.02,
   "end": 682.46,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Chi-Chi",
   "text": "LIKE HELL YOU WILL!!"
  },
  {
   "i": 231,
   "start": 682.46,
   "end": 684.3,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Oh, come on, Chi-Chi!"
  },
  {
   "i": 232,
   "start": 684.3,
   "end": 686.22,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Chi-Chi",
   "text": "Don't you \"Come on Chi-Chi\" me!"
  },
  {
   "i": 233,
   "start": 686.22,
   "end": 688.32,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Goku laughs nervously"
  },
  {
   "i": 234,
   "start": 686.22,
   "end": 692.5,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Chi-Chi",
   "text": "You're gone off in God knows where space, refuse to let the Dragon take you home, and the first thing you ask for when you get back:"
  },
  {
   "i": 235,
   "start": 692.5,
   "end": 697.84,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Chi-Chi",
   "text": "\"Oh hey, Chi-Chi. Mind if I take our baby boy to go train to FIGHT SOME MONSTER ROBOTS\"?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 236,
   "start": 697.84,
   "end": 700.48,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Androids. And the first thing I asked about was dinner."
  },
  {
   "i": 237,
   "start": 700.48,
   "end": 702.1,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Chi-Chi",
   "text": "THE ANSWER IS NO!"
  },
  {
   "i": 238,
   "start": 702.1,
   "end": 704.06,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "No to dinner, or no to Gohan?"
